      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Kukuh... Well, now that I think about it, it\r\nwasn't really surprising that you brought me here.\r\nThe depth of our connection cannot be measured\r\nby the length of time.",
        "Jp" : "クク――いや、よく考えたら\r\nお前が俺のところに持ってきたって\r\n驚くようなことじゃなかったな\r\n付き合いの深さは、時間の長さじゃ計れない"
