      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Is this cloth... a stole?\r\nIt's just right.\r\nIn this season, even in Acre Selund,\r\nthe nights get cold.",
        "Jp" : "この布は――ストールか\r\nちょうどいい\r\nこれからの季節、アッカーシェランでも\r\n夜は冷え込むんだ"
