      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When I get home, I'll try putting it on and\r\nshow it to Shem and Jan.\r\nThey would definitely want to see you.",
        "Jp" : "家に帰ったら羽織ってみることにしよう\r\nセムやジャンにも見せてやりたい\r\nきっとお前に会いたがるだろうよ"
